# Pairs with NoWaitCycle. An undivided accept has no seeding to wait for.
MODULE: AbsorbedLinkAwaitsSeed
TARGET: NoWaitCycle
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a parent that absorbs the split without dividing waits for a seeding that was never queued
PERTURBS: ParentAcceptNoOverflow

--- FIND
    /\ ch[o] = "parent"
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "return"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ch[o] = "parent"
    \* MUTATION: the accept waits for a seeding
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "seed"]
--- END
